I added `expiringSoon` at the end of `src/pumpout.ts`. It sums `left` for batches that are spendable on `day` and dead by `day + within`, and it returns 0 when `within` is 0 or less. It only reads the wallet and doesn't change it.

I couldn't see the file's body, so I wrote the date check directly from your rules instead of calling the existing `isLive` helper. The edit appends to the end of the file, so I haven't checked how it sits with the code around it.
